         MmsService.java:211: error: <anonymous ...MmsService$1> is not
         abstract and does not override abstract method
         addMultimediaMessageDraft(String,Uri) in IMms

       Commit 0cc94f1 (2024-12-02, era beku UL) = parent fbb2828,
       mengimplementasikan API 2-arg yang cocok dengan IMms fork UL.
       Diverifikasi: m MmsService exit 0. Pin sesuai kebijakan: yang
       terbukti memutus build. -->
  <remove-project name="LineageOS/android_packages_services_Mms" />
  <project name="LineageOS/android_packages_services_Mms" path="packages/services/Mms"
           groups="pdk" remote="gh"
           revision="0cc94f1ad63e6a821888784dd1c5aa945f2c4202"
           upstream="lineage-20.0" />

  <!-- Pin anti-hanyut: packages/services/Telephony @ 288c28358 (merge r28).

